# Description Master — test SKU

**Default test SKU:** `SP 12120 4OHM GTR`  
(Config: `config/marketplace_testing.php` → `description_sku`)

## Safe testing order

1. Dry-run (no API writes):
   `php artisan marketplace:audit-master description --dry-run --sku="SP 12120 4OHM GTR"`
2. Single marketplace dry-run:
   `php artisan marketplace:audit-master description --dry-run --sku="SP 12120 4OHM GTR" --marketplace=amazon`
3. Live push only after dry-run passes **and** PM description tiers are filled:
   `php artisan marketplace:audit-master description --live --sku="SP 12120 4OHM GTR" --marketplace=amazon`

## Known status for this SKU (dry-run)

- **Wiring:** 24/24 marketplaces ready (credentials + service + metrics table)
- **Content gap:** `description_1500`–`description_600` all empty — live push will fail until filled (AI generate or manual save)
- **Metrics rows:** ebay, ebay3, temu, doba, walmart have listing sync rows; `description_master` empty until first push
- **ebay2:** no metrics row; eBay API lookup on push

Do not run bulk or multi-marketplace live pushes without explicit user approval.
